{"id":"5b4211bfce9ab93a","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-inner2-iterability.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Iterability","display":"df-zfc-inner2-iterability — ZFC Inner2 Iterability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-iterability","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-iterability"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-iterability — ZFC Inner2 Iterability","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-iterability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-iterability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-iterability — ZFC Inner2 Iterability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\theta\\in V\">\\(M,\\theta\\in V\\)</span> (premouse and iteration-length bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2Iterability}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2Iterability}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\)</span> (iteration-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (ordinal predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\lambda\\times\\lambda\">\\(R\\subseteq\\lambda\\times\\lambda\\)</span> is the tree relation recovered from the iteration-tree code</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-coded branch predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BranchModelWellFounded}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(b,\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{BranchModelWellFounded}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(b,\\mathcal T)\\)</span> is the metatheoretic predicate saying that the fine-structural direct-limit model along <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> exists and its membership relation is well founded</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,R,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\lambda\\times\\lambda\\land b\\subseteq\\lambda\\land b\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in b\\;\\bigl((\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\land\\alpha\\neq\\beta)\\lor(\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\in R\\land\\beta\\neq\\alpha)\\lor\\alpha=\\beta\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\land\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to\\alpha\\in b\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\;\\exists\\beta\\in b\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,R,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\lambda\\times\\lambda\\land b\\subseteq\\lambda\\land b\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in b\\;\\bigl((\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\land\\alpha\\neq\\beta)\\lor(\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\in R\\land\\beta\\neq\\alpha)\\lor\\alpha=\\beta\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\land\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to\\alpha\\in b\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\;\\exists\\beta\\in b\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}iterability} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2Iterability}_S(M,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\mathcal T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\lambda)\\to\n\\exists R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,b\\in V\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathcal T=\\langle\\lambda,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,R,\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{BranchModelWellFounded}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(b,\\mathcal T)\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}iterability} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2Iterability}_S(M,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\mathcal T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\lambda)\\to\n\\exists R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,b\\in V\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathcal T=\\langle\\lambda,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,R,\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{BranchModelWellFounded}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(b,\\mathcal T)\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The branch order is read from the explicit relation component of the upstream iteration-tree code.  That upstream code does not contain membership relations for its stage models or a branch-model constructor, so well-foundedness of the fine-structural branch model is exposed as a declared metatheoretic interface rather than attributed to an undefined term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_b^{\\mathcal T}\">\\(M_b^{\\mathcal T}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S$ (iteration-tree predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ and $\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S$ (ordinal predicates, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2Iterability}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\lambda\\times\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BranchModelWellFounded}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(b,\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,R,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\lambda\\times\\lambda\\land b\\subseteq\\lambda\\land b\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in b\\;\\bigl((\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\land\\alpha\\neq\\beta)\\lor(\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\in R\\land\\beta\\neq\\alpha)\\lor\\alpha=\\beta\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\land\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to\\alpha\\in b\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha<\\lambda\\;\\exists\\beta\\in b\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}iterability} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2Iterability}_S(M,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\mathcal T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\lambda)\\to\n\\exists R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,b\\in V\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathcal T=\\langle\\lambda,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,R,\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{BranchModelWellFounded}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(b,\\mathcal T)\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"M_b^{\\mathcal T}","display":false}],"bytes":2651,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-inner2-iterability.md|58-df-zfc-inner2-iterability]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","92fbda0605a6cb98","5582a281f15a33c2"]}